@startuml order-placement
actor Customer
participant MobileApp
participant Backend
participant PaymentGateway
participant Restaurant
participant DeliveryPartner
Customer -> MobileApp : Browse & Add to Cart
MobileApp -> Backend : Fetch Restaurants & Menu
Customer -> MobileApp : Checkout
MobileApp -> Backend : Create Order (Pending Payment)
Backend -> PaymentGateway : Initiate Payment
PaymentGateway --> Backend : Payment Success
Backend -> Backend : Confirm Order
Backend -> Restaurant : Notify New Order
Backend -> DeliveryPartner : Assign Delivery
DeliveryPartner -> Backend : Update Status
Backend -> MobileApp : Order Status Updates
@enduml